–23: Shelves show DVDs/CDs and books — no electronics.\n- Frame 8: Counter area — no electronics visible.\n- Frame 28–30: Manga and DVDs — no Switch or phones.\n\n→ **NOT CONFIRMED.**\n\n---\n\n#### ✅ **5) Media items like DVDs or CDs visible**\n- Frame 22: Shelves with rows of DVD/CD cases (blue, pink, green spines).\n- Frame 23: Price sign “300円” near media cases.\n- Frame 24–25: Racks with what appear to be DVD/CD cases.\n- Frame 28–30: Manga and possibly anime DVDs.\n\n→ **Confirmed.**\n\n---\n\n#### ❌ **6) Miscellaneous items like trinkets or cards visible**\n- **No trinkets or cards** are visible in any frame.\n- Frame 17–21: Book about tarot — this is a *book*, not “cards” as in collectible or trading cards.\n- Frame 26–27: Vlogger holds up a manga — not cards or trinkets.\n- No keychains, figurines, or card packs visible.\n\n→ **NOT CONFIRMED.**\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThe answer **'3' (D: 'Book, phone, switch, trinkets, cards')** is **INCORRECT** because:\n\n- **Phones and Switch consoles are NOT visible.**\n- **Trinkets and cards are NOT visible.**\n- Only **books and media (DVDs/CDs)** are clearly visible and confirmed.\n\n---\n\n### Final Answer:\n**❌ No, the answer '3' is not correct.**  \nThe visible items sold are **books and media (DVDs/CDs)**, but **not phones, Switch consoles, trinkets, or cards** as claimed in choice D."}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2089.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2090.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2091.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2092.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2093.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2094.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_2095.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggug